  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005008010210,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "なんですか？　いきなりですねー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500801/2005008010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……ネイルが摩美々にとって大切なら、\r\n無下にするわけにもいかないと思ってな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005008010220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふうん……",
